WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.083
Open Codex Usage Meter to launch Codex with the sidebar badge. Use this launcher again after fully quitting Codex.

00:00:08.083 --> 00:00:14.167
Hover to see your weekly allowance, reset countdown, and reset credits. Click to pin the panel.

00:00:14.167 --> 00:00:21.417
Compare active chats by token usage. Check input, output, and cache hit rate. Expand for model details.

00:00:21.417 --> 00:00:27.333
Track daily tokens over seven days. Hover any bar for its usage. Free and open source.
